abstract: >
  NeuroBloom is a web-based platform for longitudinal cognitive monitoring
  and clinician-guided rehabilitation in multiple sclerosis. It provides
  adaptive cognitive training, longitudinal analytics, clinician review,
  and bilingual (English/Bengali) support.

keywords:
  - multiple sclerosis
  - digital health
